  Compute (2 phones × 15 clips = 30 inf): 30 × 4.3 J + 1 × 230 J Gemma  =  359 J
  TOTAL session: 2 × 25.4  +  359  =  410 J" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff;strokeColor=#444;fontSize=10;fontColor=#000;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1466" width="1410" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cmp" value="Side-by-side: cloud over cellular costs MORE per phone (radio dominates the diff):
  per-phone  wifi: 5.11 J   cell: 25.42 J   Δ = +20.31 J  (~397% more per phone)
  full session  wifi: 369 J   cell: 410 J   Δ = +41 J  (~11% more total)
Note: server vs cloud compute energy assumed equal here. Real cloud may be 10-30% lower per inf if A100/H100 fp16 is faster than A6000 fp16." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f0f0ff;strokeColor=#446;fontSize=10;fontColor=#000;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1594" width="1410" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
